{
    "title": "World Travel Stories - Airport",
    "description": "Welcome to the World Travel Stories adventure game and explore a new world, making every day a new vacation story! The Magic travel world is where you can explore, shop, and discover the wonders of the urban landscape. Perfect for those who love travel town adventures and enjoy engaging girl stories. Start your adventure by catching your flight at the airport, resting at the exotic hotel in the jungle, and creating the most exciting vacation stories in the Stories World Travels game. Whether discovering new locations, embarking on a doll adventure, or exploring my city, there's something here for everyone. Discover new exciting locations chock full of crazy interactions with your favorite dolls!\r\n\r\nWorld Travel Stories game will drop you off in a packed airport; what happens next is entirely up to you. It is your travel story where there are no rules. No limits. You can explore various travel towns with unique charm and attractions. Wander through bustling streets, visit famous landmarks and shopping shops, and immerse yourself in the vibrant culture of each city. Place your doll's characters anywhere, explore shops, dress them up, discover intriguing stores, and interact with numerous exciting objects in vibrant new environments worldwide.\r\n\r\n**Start your trip from the International Airport**.\r\n\r\nThe initial free destination features a bustling city, a cozy travelers' home, and a state-of-the-art international airport, offering thousands of interactions and 19 incredible characters. It's a great beginning to start your journey.\r\n\r\n**Engaging Girl Stories and Adventures**\r\n\r\nOur Town Travels Stories feature girl stories that keep players engaged. This game turns every journey into an adventure, making urban travel fun and informative. The world is yours! Let your imagination run wild to create the most incredible stories.\r\n\r\n**Enjoy Shopping Spree**\r\n\r\nWorld Travel Stories game offers a thrilling shopping experience for those who love shopping. Explore virtual stores, choose outfits, and enjoy a fun-filled shopping spree. This feature adds exciting emotions to your urban travel stories, making each city visit more engaging and enjoyable.\r\n\r\n**Endless Doll Adventures**\r\n\r\nExperience endless doll adventures in a vibrant urban setting. Customize your doll, embark on thrilling quests, and discover hidden treasures. The game offers endless fun, ensuring you always have activities.\r\n\r\n**Discover New Locations**\r\n\r\nHead to the airport and embark on journeys to exotic new destinations. From bustling cityscapes to serene beaches, every destination is a new discovery. This feature allows you to experience the thrill of air travel and explore diverse cultures, enhancing your understanding of the world. Let your imagination soar as you embark on these exciting journeys.\r\n\r\n- ***SUBARA for everyone****\r\n\r\nWe create digital experiences filled with fun and creativity that ignite the imaginations of millions of players of all ages worldwide.\r\n\r\n- ***Features****\r\n- Free play mode you'll love. Your world, your rules.\r\n- Exotic new locations full of charming customizable characters.\r\n- Lightning-fast traveling from one location to another.\r\n- Game progress is auto-saved. Continue your fantastic story the next day.\r\n- Capture the most magical moments during your adventures with the Camera mode.\r\n- New updates will roll in, with additional destinations, characters, and many things to do.\r\n\r\nWhat wondrous things will you discover in these remote destinations?\r\n\r\nFind out for yourself in this extraordinary adventure today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the World Travel Stories adventure game and explore a new world, making every day a new vacation story! The Magic travel world is where you can explore, shop, and discover the wonders of the urban landscape. Perfect for those who love travel town adventures and enjoy engaging girl stories. Start your adventure by catching your flight at the airport, resting at the exotic hotel in the jungle, and creating the most exciting vacation stories in the Stories World Travels game. Whether discovering new locations, embarking on a doll adventure, or exploring my city, there&#39;s something here for everyone. Discover new exciting locations chock full of crazy interactions with your favorite dolls!<br><br>World Travel Stories game will drop you off in a packed airport; what happens next is entirely up to you. It is your travel story where there are no rules. No limits. You can explore various travel towns with unique charm and attractions. Wander through bustling streets, visit famous landmarks and shopping shops, and immerse yourself in the vibrant culture of each city. Place your doll&#39;s characters anywhere, explore shops, dress them up, discover intriguing stores, and interact with numerous exciting objects in vibrant new environments worldwide.<br><br>**Start your trip from the International Airport**.<br><br>The initial free destination features a bustling city, a cozy travelers&#39; home, and a state-of-the-art international airport, offering thousands of interactions and 19 incredible characters. It&#39;s a great beginning to start your journey.<br><br>**Engaging Girl Stories and Adventures**<br><br>Our Town Travels Stories feature girl stories that keep players engaged. This game turns every journey into an adventure, making urban travel fun and informative. The world is yours! Let your imagination run wild to create the most incredible stories.<br><br>**Enjoy Shopping Spree**<br><br>World Travel Stories game offers a thrilling sh